WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.039
FOCUS means Function, Owner, Customer, Use Case and Scope.

00:00:04.039 --> 00:00:07.630
Here the function is a sample estimate draft.

00:00:07.630 --> 00:00:09.425
A person owns review.

00:00:09.425 --> 00:00:11.220
The customer is fictional.

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:17.055
The use case uses approved sample details, and the scope excludes live integrations.

00:00:17.055 --> 00:00:19.748
These boundaries make the work testable.
